        "quote": "(a) It shall be unlawful for the owner of any building adjacent to any of the streets, avenues or alleys of the City to construct an areaway adjacent to or around any building erected on the street, avenue or alley, and to construct a basement or cellarway under the sidewalk adjacent to the building.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.05.090:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
